  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa-Australia Partnership for Climate Responsive Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment would fund an expansion of ACIAR&#x2019;s research projects into additional African countries. Addressing food security is one of the three key objectives of the draft Australia-Africa Development Partnership Plan for Africa, and ACIAR would play a key role in achieving this. 

Africa Branch has previously provided supplementary funding for ACIAR research in Africa, including projects that explored transforming smallholder irrigation into profitable and self-sustaining systems. Rather than Africa Branch periodically funding specific projects, this investment would provide ACIAR with the flexibility to determine how to spend the AUD 5 million annual allocation, in-line with pre-agreed principles, and significantly simplify the Pan-Africa ODA program.</narrative>
  </description>
